OL,3,GNEWSAData centre developer calls for
OL,4,Apublic feedback as plans take step
OL,5,Aforward
OL,6,
OL,7,FDevelopers behind plans for a #2bn data
OL,8,Fcentre in southern Scotland are calling
OL,9,Ffor feedback from the public as the
OL,10,Fproject takes another step forward.
OL,12,FThe Sunlaws Development Company has
OL,13,Fsubmitted a proposal of application
OL,14,Fnotice to Scottish Borders Council - a
OL,15,Fdocument which must be lodged at least
OL,16,F12 weeks before any planning
OL,17,Fapplication.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
