OL,3,GNEWSAData centre developer calls for
OL,4,Apublic feedback as plans take step
OL,5,Aforward
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt said this was an "important
OL,8,Fmilestone" and marked the beginning of
OL,9,Fa public consultation on its Southside
OL,10,FData Centre in the Lammermuir Hills -
OL,11,Fwhich it says would create 145
OL,12,Fhigh-quality jobs.
OL,14,FCampaign group Save the Lammermuirs `
OL,15,FStop the Data Centre has described the
OL,16,Fproject as a "monster" and the "wrong
OL,17,Fdevelopment in the wrong place".
